stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ImageReceived : user submits image

    ImageReceived --> Validating
    Validating --> Rejected : invalid image (FR-SCAN-2)
    Rejected --> [*]

    Validating --> IdentifyingSpecies : validated

    IdentifyingSpecies --> UnrecognizedPlant : confidence < threshold (FR-AI-12)
    UnrecognizedPlant --> [*]

    IdentifyingSpecies --> ClassifyingDisease : species recognized

    ClassifyingDisease --> DetectingPests
    DetectingPests --> LocalizingRegion
    LocalizingRegion --> EstimatingSeverity
    EstimatingSeverity --> ScoringConfidence

    ScoringConfidence --> LowConfidenceFlagged : confidence < threshold (BR1)
    ScoringConfidence --> HighConfidence : confidence ≥ threshold

    LowConfidenceFlagged --> GeneratingExplainability
    HighConfidence --> GeneratingExplainability

    GeneratingExplainability --> RetrievingTreatment
    RetrievingTreatment --> FetchingWeather

    FetchingWeather --> WeatherUnavailable : timeout/error (NFR-AVAIL-2)
    FetchingWeather --> WeatherAvailable : success

    WeatherUnavailable --> GeneratingRecommendation : weather fields omitted (BR7)
    WeatherAvailable --> GeneratingRecommendation

    GeneratingRecommendation --> GeneratingReport
    GeneratingReport --> Persisted : saved immutably (BR2, NFR-DATA-1)
    Persisted --> Completed
    Completed --> [*]

    Completed --> Superseded : agronomist issues correction\n(creates new linked record,\noriginal remains immutable)
    Superseded --> [*]
